{"id":"e4fc1308e7a82e12","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-langlands-shahidi.md","title":"Langlands–Shahidi Method","display":"df-langlands-shahidi — Langlands–Shahidi Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-langlands-shahidi","aliases":["58-df-langlands-shahidi"],"display":"df-langlands-shahidi — Langlands–Shahidi Method","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-langlands-shahidi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-langlands-shahidi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-langlands-shahidi — Langlands–Shahidi Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (global field), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (quasi-split reductive group), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=MN\">\\(P=MN\\)</span> (maximal parabolic)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> (globally generic cuspidal automorphic representation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\mathbb A_F)\">\\(M(\\mathbb A_F)\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i\">\\(r_i\\)</span> (irreducible constituent of the relevant adjoint action of the dual Levi group)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> (place of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (finite set containing ramified and archimedean places), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> (convergence domain)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S\\)</span> (background method predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S\\)</span> (properties defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}euler}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S(L^S,L_\\bullet,\\mathcal D,F,G,P,\\pi,r_i,S)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S(F,G,P,\\pi,r_i)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land S\\subseteq\\Omega_F\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L^S,\\mathcal D,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L_\\bullet,\\Omega_F\\setminus S,\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D})\n\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(\nL^S(s)=\\prod_{v\\in\\Omega_F\\setminus S}L_\\bullet(v)(s)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}euler}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S(L^S,L_\\bullet,\\mathcal D,F,G,P,\\pi,r_i,S)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S(F,G,P,\\pi,r_i)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land S\\subseteq\\Omega_F\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L^S,\\mathcal D,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L_\\bullet,\\Omega_F\\setminus S,\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D})\n\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(\nL^S(s)=\\prod_{v\\in\\Omega_F\\setminus S}L_\\bullet(v)(s)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}local}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}local}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Shahidi (1990): multiplicativity of local coefficients.</li>\n<li>The method extracts local coefficients and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>-, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>-factors from normalized intertwining operators for suitable generic data.</li>\n<li>The convergence domain is now a public argument, and the supplied local-factor family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\">\\(L_\\bullet\\)</span> is typed and actually used in the Euler product; the previous formula silently used unrelated symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_v\">\\(L_v\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Automorphic representations, dual-group adjoint constituents and normalized intertwining operators are outside the current set-level dependency closure, so both turnstiles are marked metatheoretic.</li>\n<li>It does not define an arbitrary Rankin–Selberg factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(s,\\pi\\otimes\\pi&#39;)\">\\(L(s,\\pi\\otimes\\pi&#39;)\\)</span> for an unspecified pair of representations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finite}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"P=MN","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\mathbb A_F)","display":false},{"tex":"r_i","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}euler}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiEulerProduct}_S(L^S,L_\\bullet,\\mathcal D,F,G,P,\\pi,r_i,S)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiDatum}_S(F,G,P,\\pi,r_i)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\\\\n&\\land S\\subseteq\\Omega_F\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L^S,\\mathcal D,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Function}(L_\\bullet,\\Omega_F\\setminus S,\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal D})\n\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(\nL^S(s)=\\prod_{v\\in\\Omega_F\\setminus S}L_\\bullet(v)(s)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}shahidi\\text{-}local}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{LanglandsShahidiLocalFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NormalizedIntertwiningFactor}_S(L_v,\\gamma_v,P_v,\\pi_v,r_i)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"L_v","display":false},{"tex":"L(s,\\pi\\otimes\\pi')","display":false}],"bytes":2972,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-755","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-langlands-shahidi.md|58-df-langlands-shahidi]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}